BS-QoRdaVHj_hdVvH7Z7lAHpdKDqMu9HvZggn8KMrqK27JULQb8OopVkiOO7mtjn0tu33F5bOmg7PmEa1XhH50kt5fhz0PgdhO3rIwFyX05d1pig8OX83wNApYB40EWqJGtLsKzL4ACY1C8vKMrgWGBThIT365_EITmk1bUDyd7vIXU75oQj0Co74_pf7sToevnHte4P4JwpKB63rAM0O8eLxZUnB8XobOPqMLJKb5IcoENW3Uqor1Ajarv7R_YA0kWbyzmnp1tYgDWgMuUUi-NYLcP2EbXPKM-gB7YUUgideQHFcsyFyH55YflQIhuTf6K4p1qJrV_UG9iX6HBQIH30Kwx6sw65W_oq0Lx6HY4tEx-sCNfAw0Ya1dMZzyXhyOqv6m6iP9c_MVW9262Qdb4nd7Rnhe_eB3XKKja-UotfNvHriu7PIHT7DZDM1TNQFUhTmvN67H2sbzEWXDiCi9RPMuyuUk9WbAksF0UlObz3K55vr_la9qbTRsWmrpT1B4wAwAyj7zI5iuQ46n0J078oaSfxqoma1hPxaBQz7BB_Jq2TSnd5KgwTIn_cvmHI_ojEnaYWb2agEPsS78s4_-Co4ASnFFkgSSVI5","name":"exec","arguments":{"command":"python3 -c \"\nimport json, os\n\ndata = {\n  \\\"status\\\": \\\"ok\\\",\n  \\\"story_id\\\": \\\"ondo-finance-founder-nathan-allman-passes-away\\\",\n  \\\"topic_theme\\\": \\\"Ondo Finance Founder Nathan Allman Passes Away Unexpectedly at 32\\\",\n  \\\"primary_keyword\\\": \\\"Nathan Allman Ondo Finance\\\",\n  \\\"primary_headline\\\": \\\"Ondo Finance Founder Nathan Allman Passes Away Aged 32, Ian De Bode Named CEO\\\",\n  \\\"primary_asset\\\": \\\"Ondo\\\",\n  \\\"chart_coin\\\": \\\"ondo-finance\\\",\n  \\\"sources_used\\\": [\n    \\\"CoinDesk\\\",\n    \\\"CoinTelegraph\\\"\n  ],\n  \\\"source_urls\\\": [\n    \\\"https://www.coindesk.com/markets/2026/05/26/ondo-finance-founder-nathan-allman-passes-away\\\",\n    \\\"https://cointelegraph.com/news/ondo-finance-founder-nathan-allman-passes-away-aged-32\\\"\n  ],\n  \\\"combined_key_facts\\\": [\n    \\\"Nathan Allman, the founder of pioneering real-world asset (RWA) tokenization firm Ondo Finance, has died unexpectedly at the age of 32.\\\",\n    \\\"Ian De Bode, Ondo's longtime president who has overseen strategy, product, and day-to-day operations for over two years, has been appointed as the new CEO.\\\",\n    \\\"Allman was a Brown University graduate who previously worked on Goldman Sachs' digital assets team before founding Ondo in 2021 and establishing a crypto hedge fund called ChainStreet Capital.\\\",\n    \\\"Under Allman's leadership, Ondo grew to manage over $3.5 billion in total value locked (TVL), pioneering tokenized real-world assets like the yield-bearing USDY stablecoin and the OUSG Treasury fund.\\\",\n    \\\"Ondo Finance confirmed the passing in a statement on Tuesday, stating that Allman's family has requested privacy and no cause of death has been disclosed.\\\"\n  ],\n  \\\"aggregated_raw_content\\\": \\\"\\\"\\\"Ondo Finance founder Nathan Allman has died unexpectedly, the company announced on Tuesday, May 26, 2026. The real-world asset (RWA) tokenization pioneer was 32 years old. Following the tragic news, Ondo announced that its longtime president, Ian De Bode, will step in as the company's new Chief Executive Officer.\n\n'It is with profound sadness that we announce the unexpected passing of Nathan Allman, Ondo’s founder. Our hearts are with his family and loved ones,' Ondo Finance said in an official statement on X. 'Nate's brilliance, humility, and drive shaped every part of what Ondo is today. His belief in the power of technology to create a more open, accessible financial system lives on in everything we build.'\n\nIan De Bode, who has spent over two years overseeing strategy, product, and day-to-day operations as president, has the full support and confidence of the leadership team as he takes the helm. 'It’s been an incredibly sad day for Ondo Finance,' De Bode told Cointelegraph. 'Nate was not only an incredible founder and visionary, but also a very close personal friend. He will be missed dearly. The mission of Ondo, Nate's mission, has not changed. If Nate were here, he would want to continue executing with excellence. We will make him proud.'\n\nNathan Allman graduated from Brown University and spent time working in Goldman Sachs’ digital asset division before founding Ondo Finance in 2021. Prior to Ondo, he also founded ChainStreet Capital, an algorithmic, event-driven crypto hedge fund. Under Allman's leadership, Ondo Finance became a titan of the tokenized real-world asset (RWA) space, capturing Wall Street's attention—including investment giants like BlackRock—by bridging traditional finance with decentralized rails.\n\nOndo’s products grew to achieve over $3.5 billion in total value locked (TVL). Its signature products include USDY, a yield-bearing tokenized stablecoin; OUSG, a tokenized U.S. Treasury fund; and tokenized equities offered via Ondo Global Markets. \n\nBen Grossman, Ondo's Vice President and Head of Marketing, praised Allman's legacy: 'Nate was a once-in-a-generation founder and visionary. He was absolutely brilliant, with a vision and drive that shaped the industry and everyone around him. He will be enormously missed.' The company stated that continuing Allman's vision to construct a more accessible financial system remains the most meaningful way to honor his memory. The family has requested privacy during this difficult time, and Ondo has not released further details surrounding the cause of death.\\\"\\\"\\\"\n}\n\nos.makedirs('/tmp/crypto-run-20260526-080115/research', exist_ok=True)\nwith open('/tmp/crypto-run-20260526-080115/research/raw.json', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(data, f, indent=2)\n\nwith open('/tmp/researcher-raw.txt', 'w') as f:\n    json.dump(data, f, indent=2)\n\nprint('Done')\n\""}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"local-bifrost","model":"gemini-3.5-flash","usage":{"input":2562,"output":1652,"cacheRead":23514,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":27728,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1779782526914,"responseId":"gFMVav3XGKrs694PlvzqmQI"}}
